    "grounding_mode": "contextual_synthesis",
    "text": "In the DBSCAN algorithm, core points within a distance Eps of each other are assigned to the same cluster, and border points that are close enough to a core point are also included in that cluster, though a border point may fall within the neighborhoods of several core points.",
